{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15555","headline":"南至日太史登台书云物 · 裴逵","name":"南至日太史登台书云物","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圆丘才展礼，佳气近初分。\n太史新簪笔，高台纪彩云。\n烟空和缥缈，晓色共氛氲。\n道泰资贤辅，年丰荷圣君。\n恭惟司国瑞，兼用察人文。\n应念怀铅客，终朝望碧雰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴逵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15555.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15555","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}